      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "导致死亡：当一个事件的结果为“死亡”，则可明确地作为严重不良事件进行记录和报告。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "严重不良事件（SAE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p998"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27640,
      "source_ref": "body.p998",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p998"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-e2f80718a15f7b296906c055",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "危及生命：在此是指在发生不良事件时参与者已经处于死亡的危险中，并不是指假设该不良事件如果更严重可能导致死亡。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "严重不良事件（SAE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p999"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
