    },
    {
      "excerpt": "药物不良反应（ADR）",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "药物不良反应（ADR）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1015"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27810,
      "source_ref": "body.p1015",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1015"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-180c41280dcf6cc53ea1efa4",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "药物不良反应（Adverse Drug Reaction，ADR）：指临床试验中发生的任何与研究药物可能有关的对人体有害或者非期望的反应。研究药物与AE之间的因果关系至少有一个合理的可能性，即不能排除相关性。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "药物不良反应（ADR）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1016"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27820,
      "source_ref": "body.p1016",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1016"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-5c3db876078a3e60f5b5017f",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "可疑且非预期严重不良反应（SUSAR）",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "可疑且非预期严重不良反应（SUSAR）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1017"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27830,
      "source_ref": "body.p1017",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1017"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-f59a09007b7f5f516b7d01eb",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "可疑且非预期严重不良反应（Suspected Unexpected Serious Adverse Reaction，SUSAR）指临床表现的性质和严重程度超出了试验药物《研究者手册》、已上市药品的说明书或者产品特性摘要等已有资料信息的可疑并且非预期的严重不良反应。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "可疑且非预期严重不良反应（SUSAR）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1018"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27840,
      "source_ref": "body.p1018",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1018"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-3a466b9df7a0012b972a2b3d",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "非预期不良反应指不良反应的性质、严重程度、后果或频率，不同于试验药物当前相关资料（如《研究者手册》等文件）所描述的预期风险。《研究者手册》作为主要文件提供用以判断某不良反应是否预期或非预期的安全性参考信息。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "可疑且非预期严重不良反应（SUSAR）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1019"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
