    },
    {
      "excerpt": "不良事件的收集",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的收集和记录",
        "不良事件的收集"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1021"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27870,
      "source_ref": "body.p1021",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1021"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-ebb4aba58a5eee9f10138511",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "本试验中，不良事件收集期应从参与者首次服用试验用药品后至最后一次安全性随访或者退出研究为止（以先发生时间为准）。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的收集和记录",
        "不良事件的收集"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1022"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27880,
      "source_ref": "body.p1022",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1022"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-5c30706befa51335bc524ec6",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "在签署知情同意书后到首次服用试验用药品之前，发生的临床不良医学事件作为病史/伴随疾病记录在原始病历中，不作为AE记录。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的收集和记录",
        "不良事件的收集"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1023"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27890,
      "source_ref": "body.p1023",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1023"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-a4ee984ed31aa5fe26aa9401",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "从首次服用试验用药品至末次访视期间发生的所有AE均需记录在eCRF中。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的收集和记录",
        "不良事件的收集"
      ],
